\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_011_操夢.wav"},{"animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"713C240C-C3A7-4F59-86AF-3FF1BEA3BC98","duration":4.46297052154195,"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","telop":"「ええ、そう。ここが紫にばれないとは限らないし…」","title":"シーン 12","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.012.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.726417233560091,"voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","slideTitle":"スライド #12","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_八雲紫.wav"},{"animationName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E6465A32-75C2-41A6-8979-C5359308010E","duration":4.073469387755102,"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですね…、僕はそう言いながら、霊夢たちを見る。」","title":"シーン 13","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.013.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.473469387755102,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"スライド #13","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_操夢.wav"},{"animationName":"なし","id":"78B7C75A-3485-4BA1-B568-3743EAC61CD9","duration":3.5,"transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、霊夢が口を開く。","title":"シーン 14","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.014.jpeg","voiceDuration":1.9039002267573697,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slide